ng h\u7907\'3fp x\u7917\'3f l}{\f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \'fd \'f0\u7873\'3fu ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 bi}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \'ean b\u7843\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp ph\'e1p.
