c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \'e3 t\'ednh theo bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f. V\'ed d\u7909\'3f 1 h\u7897\'3f bu\'f4n b\'e1n m\u7929\'3f ph\u7849\'3fm (l\'e0 m\u7863\'3ft h\'e0ng c\u7847\'3fn h}{
\f47\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \u7841\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f) c\'f3 l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\'e0 4.500\'f0/th\'e1ng, thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc t\'ednh theo bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\'e0: 4.500
\'f0 x 70% (thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft t\u7889\'3fi \'f0a 60% + thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft b\u7893\'3f sung 10%) = 3.150\'f0; ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp th\'eam 10% l\'e0 315\'f0; c\u7897\'3fng s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3f
c doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp h\u7897\'3f n\'e0y ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp l\'e0 3.456\'f0 (3.150\'f0 + 315\'f0).}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 
