\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng x\'e9t c\u7847\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn ch\u7871\'3f trong \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng. C\u7909\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp c\u7847\'3fn theo d}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \'f5i, h}{
