\par }{\f39\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 b) \'d0\u7875\'3f c\'f3 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc 10% cho c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp t\'e1c x}{\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid867582\charrsid5003811 \'e3 ph\u7909\'3fc v
