m v.v..) kinh doanh theo gia ch\u7881\'3f \'f0\u7841\'3fo c\u7911\'3fa Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc , UBND t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc TW c\u7847\'3fn quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 ho\u7863\'3fc khung gi
\'e1 ti\u7873\'3fn c\'f4ng ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f; tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc h\u7871\'3ft l\'e0 gi\'e1 c\'f4ng may qu\u7847\'3fn \'e1o, u\u7889\'3fn t\'f3c, c\u7855\'3ft t\'f3c, s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa xe \'f0\u7841\'3fp, gi\u7919\'3f xe \'f0\u7841\'3fp v
\'e0 xe m\'e1y... 
\par c) Vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\u7897\'3f quan h\u7879\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7875\'3f \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f gi\u7843\'3fm thu\u7871\'3f 5% (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3
